@* Họ và tên: Đào Văn Khánh | Mã sinh viên: 23103100125 | Nội dung thực hiện: Module 2.7 - Liên kết danh mục ngành tuyển sinh công khai. (Layout gốc)
   Layout dùng chung toàn hệ thống: header + sidebar theo vai trò (thiết kế Figma). *@
@using QuanLyTuyenSinh_UNETI1_TI17A3HN3HN.Models
@{
    var ctrl = ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() ?? "";
    var act  = ViewContext.RouteData.Values["action"]?.ToString() ?? "";

    var isAuth    = User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true;
    var role      = User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Role)?.Value ?? "";
    bool isAdmin  = User.IsInRole(VaiTro.Admin);
    bool isStaff  = isAdmin || User.IsInRole(VaiTro.CanBoTuyenSinh);
    bool isStudent = User.IsInRole(VaiTro.ThiSinh);

    var hoTen = User.Identity?.Name;
    if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(hoTen)) hoTen = "Người dùng";
    var chuCai = string.Concat(hoTen.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries)
                                    .Select(p => p[0]).TakeLast(2)).ToUpper();

    bool Is(string c, string a) => ctrl == c && act == a;
    bool Ctrl(string c) => ctrl == c;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Quản Lý Tuyển Sinh UNETI</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/QuanLyTuyenSinh_UNETI1_TI17A3HN3HN.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/ui.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Styles", required: false)
</head>
<body class="ui-body">
    <header class="ui-topbar">
        <button type="button" class="ui-menu-btn" id="uiMenuBtn" aria-label="Mở menu">
            <partial name="_Icon" model='("menu", 22)' />
        </button>

        <a class="ui-brand" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
            <span class="ui-brand__logo"><partial name="_Icon" model='("graduation-cap", 24)' /></span>
            <span class="ui-brand__text">
                <span class="ui-brand__name">UNETI</span>
                <span class="ui-brand__sub">QUẢN LÝ TUYỂN SINH</span>
            </span>
        </a>

        <div class="ui-topbar__school">Trường Đại học Kinh tế - Kỹ thuật Công nghiệp</div>

        <div class="ui-chip">
            <partial name="_Icon" model='("calendar", 15)' />
            <span>Đại học chính quy 2026</span>
        </div>

        @if (isAuth)
        {
            <span class="ui-topbar__sep"></span>
            <div class="ui-account">
                <span class="ui-avatar">@chuCai</span>
                <span class="ui-account__info">
                    <span class="ui-account__name">@hoTen</span>
                    <span class="ui-account__role">@role</span>
                </span>
            </div>
            <form asp-controller="TaiKhoan" asp-action="DangXuat" method="post" class="ui-logout">
                <button type="submit" class="ui-btn ui-btn--ghost">Đăng xuất</button>
            </form>
        }
        else
        {
            <a class="ui-btn ui-btn--light" asp-controller="TaiKhoan" asp-action="DangNhap">Đăng nhập</a>
        }
    </header>

    <div class="ui-workspace">
        <aside class="ui-sidebar" id="uiSidebar">
            <div class="ui-sidebar__title">HỆ THỐNG TUYỂN SINH</div>

            <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Ctrl("Home") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                <partial name="_Icon" model='("layout-dashboard", 17)' /><span>Trang chủ</span>
            </a>
            <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Is("NganhTuyenSinh", "CongKhai") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="NganhTuyenSinh" asp-action="CongKhai">
                <partial name="_Icon" model='("graduation-cap", 17)' /><span>Ngành tuyển sinh</span>
            </a>

            @if (isStaff)
            {
                @if (isAdmin)
                {
                    <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Ctrl("Khoa") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="Khoa" asp-action="Index">
                        <partial name="_Icon" model='("building-2", 17)' /><span>Khoa (M1)</span>
                    </a>
                }
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Is("NganhTuyenSinh", "Index") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="NganhTuyenSinh" asp-action="Index">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("graduation-cap", 17)' /><span>Quản lý ngành (M2)</span>
                </a>
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Ctrl("ThiSinh") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="ThiSinh" asp-action="Index">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("users", 17)' /><span>Quản lý thí sinh (M3)</span>
                </a>
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Ctrl("HoSoXetTuyen") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="HoSoXetTuyen" asp-action="Index">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("files", 17)' /><span>Hồ sơ xét tuyển (M4)</span>
                </a>

                <hr class="ui-sidebar__divider" />

                <div class="ui-sidebar__module">
                    <div class="ui-sidebar__module-title">PHỎNG VẤN & KẾT QUẢ</div>
                    <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--module @(Is("LichPhongVan", "Dashboard") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="Dashboard">
                        <partial name="_Icon" model='("chart-no-axes-combined", 18)' /><span>Tổng quan</span>
                    </a>
                    <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--module @(Is("LichPhongVan", "Index") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="Index">
                        <partial name="_Icon" model='("calendar-days", 18)' /><span>Lịch phỏng vấn</span>
                    </a>
                    <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--module @(Is("LichPhongVan", "Create") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="Create">
                        <partial name="_Icon" model='("plus", 18)' /><span>Lập lịch phỏng vấn</span>
                    </a>
                    <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--module @(Is("LichPhongVan", "ThongKe") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="ThongKe">
                        <partial name="_Icon" model='("clipboard-check", 18)' /><span>Báo cáo thống kê</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            }
            else if (isStudent)
            {
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Is("ThiSinh", "ThongTinCaNhan") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="ThiSinh" asp-action="ThongTinCaNhan">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("user", 17)' /><span>Hồ sơ cá nhân</span>
                </a>
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Ctrl("HoSoThiSinh") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="HoSoThiSinh" asp-action="TheoDoi">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("files", 17)' /><span>Nguyện vọng của tôi</span>
                </a>
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Is("LichPhongVan", "LichCuaToi") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="LichCuaToi">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("calendar-days", 17)' /><span>Lịch PV &amp; Kết quả</span>
                </a>
            }
            else
            {
                <a class="ui-nav ui-nav--general @(Is("LichPhongVan", "LichCuaToi") ? "is-active" : "")" asp-controller="LichPhongVan" asp-action="LichCuaToi">
                    <partial name="_Icon" model='("search", 17)' /><span>Tra cứu kết quả</span>
                </a>
            }

            <div class="ui-datanote">
                <strong>Kỳ tuyển sinh 2026</strong>
                <span>Dữ liệu tại<br />@DateTime.Now.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy · HH:mm") (GMT+7)</span>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main role="main" class="ui-page">
            @RenderBody()

            <footer class="ui-pagefoot">
                <span>&copy; 2026 - Nhóm 01 - Lớp TI17A3HN - Đề tài 21: Quản lý tuyển sinh và hồ sơ xét tuyển Đại học UNETI</span>
                <span>Dữ liệu tại @DateTime.Now.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy, HH:mm")</span>
            </footer>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    <script>
        document.getElementById('uiMenuBtn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
            document.body.classList.toggle('ui-menu-open');
        });
    </script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
